  "extractionNotes": "Paid periods printed in a ZUS internal note (payments made): 2026-01-27..2026-06-15 and 2026-06-16..2027-01-25. The child was taken into care on 2026-01-26 (same date as the interim court care order); the benefit starts the next day. The plan keeps the filed start; the engine must accept a start after takenIntoCareOn. The court order is an interim order for the duration of adoption proceedings, not a final adoption order, so finalOrderOn is absent. Spouses were entrusted jointly. Child aged about 1 year 9 months at care. Leave application date on the Z-3 precedes the care date. Rate not in the file (81.5% inferred from the joint maternity + parental leave). Employer remark: a bonus paid in 2025-11 is reduced during benefit periods and still applies (column 8, actual amount). Column 6 is the contractual amount; contributionBase inferred as column 6 plus column 8. asOf = query date of the ZUS titles screen next to the payment note (last document ZUS relied on)."
